{
  "info": {
    "name": "Glow & Grace E-Commerce API",
    "description": "Complete API collection for the Glow & Grace skincare e-commerce platform.\\n\\n## Base URL\\nAll requests use `{{base_url}}` — set this variable (default: http://127.0.0.1:8000/api).\\n\\n## Authentication\\n- **Register** or **Login** to get a token.\\n- The collection has a `token` variable that gets auto-set via the Login/Register test scripts.\\n- Protected routes automatically include `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`.\\n\\n## Workflow Order\\n1. Register or Login as a customer\\n2. Browse products & categories\\n3. Add items to cart / wishlist\\n4. Checkout (requires a saved address)\\n5. View orders & submit reviews",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "codebuff"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "product_slug",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "product_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "category_slug",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "cart_item_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "order_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "review_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "address_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔐 Auth",
      "description": "Authentication endpoints — register, login, logout, and get the current user.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('product_id', '');",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('cart_item_id', '');",
                  "    console.log('Token saved:', json.token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Jane Doe\",\n  \"email\": \"jane@example.com\",\n  \"phone\": \"+855-12-345-678\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/register",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["register"]
            },
            "description": "Register a new customer account. Returns a user object + Bearer token.\\n\\n**Validation rules:**\\n- `name` — required, string, max:255\\n- `email` — required, email, unique:users\\n- `phone` — nullable, string, max:20\\n- `password` — required, string, min:8, confirmed\\n- `password_confirmation` — required (must match password)"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Registration Success",
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Registration successful.\",\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": 3,\n    \"name\": \"Jane Doe\",\n    \"email\": \"jane@example.com\",\n    \"phone\": \"+855-12-345-678\",\n    \"avatar\": null,\n    \"status\": \"active\",\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-07-01T10:30:00.000000Z\"\n  },\n  \"token\": \"3|abc123def456...\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Validation Error",
              "status": "Unprocessable Entity",
              "code": 422,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"The email has already been taken.\",\n  \"errors\": {\n    \"email\": [\"The email has already been taken.\"]\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "    console.log('Token saved:', json.token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"jane@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"device_name\": \"postman\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["login"]
            },
            "description": "Authenticate with email + password. Returns a user object + Bearer token.\\n\\n**Tip:** Use the pre-seeded customer account: `customer@test.com` / `password`\\n\\n**Validation rules:**\\n- `email` — required, email\\n- `password` — required, string, min:6\\n- `device_name` — nullable, string, max:255"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Login Success",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Login successful.\",\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": 1,\n    \"name\": \"John Customer\",\n    \"email\": \"customer@test.com\",\n    \"phone\": \"+1-555-0101\",\n    \"avatar\": null,\n    \"status\": \"active\",\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-07-01T10:00:00.000000Z\"\n  },\n  \"token\": \"2|def789ghi012...\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Invalid Credentials",
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Invalid email or password.\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Current User",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/user",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["user"]
            },
            "description": "Get the authenticated user's profile. Requires Bearer token."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "User Profile",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": 1,\n    \"name\": \"John Customer\",\n    \"email\": \"customer@test.com\",\n    \"phone\": \"+1-555-0101\",\n    \"avatar\": null,\n    \"status\": \"active\",\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-07-01T10:00:00.000000Z\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/logout",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["logout"]
            },
            "description": "Revoke the current API token. Requires Bearer token."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Logout Success",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Logged out successfully.\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "📦 Products",
      "description": "Browse and search products. All endpoints are public (no auth required).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Products",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (json.data && json.data.length > 0) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('product_id', json.data[0].id.toString());",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('product_slug', json.data[0].slug);",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/products?per_page=12&sort=latest",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["products"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "per_page", "value": "12", "description": "Results per page (max 50)" },
                { "key": "sort", "value": "latest", "description": "latest, oldest, price_asc, price_desc, name_asc" },
                { "key": "category_id", "value": "", "description": "Filter by category ID", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "featured", "value": "1", "description": "Filter featured products only", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "min_price", "value": "", "description": "Minimum price filter", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "max_price", "value": "", "description": "Maximum price filter", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "description": "List active products with optional filters. Public endpoint.\\n\\n**Query parameters:**\\n- `per_page` — results per page (default: 12, max: 50)\\n- `sort` — sort order: latest, oldest, price_asc, price_desc, name_asc\\n- `category_id` — filter by category\\n- `featured` — 1 to show only featured products\\n- `min_price` / `max_price` — price range filter"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Products List",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 1,\n      \"name\": \"Hydrating Facial Serum\",\n      \"slug\": \"hydrating-facial-serum\",\n      \"short_description\": \"A lightweight serum for deep hydration\",\n      \"price\": 29.99,\n      \"compare_price\": 39.99,\n      \"has_discount\": true,\n      \"discount_percent\": 25,\n      \"in_stock\": true,\n      \"quantity\": 50,\n      \"is_featured\": true,\n      \"primary_image\": \"http://127.0.0.1:8000/storage/products/1-primary.jpg\",\n      \"category\": {\n        \"id\": 1,\n        \"name\": \"Skincare\",\n        \"slug\": \"skincare\",\n        \"description\": null,\n        \"image\": null,\n        \"sort_order\": 1,\n        \"products_count\": 10,\n        \"children\": []\n      },\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-07-01T10:00:00.000000Z\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"current_page\": 1,\n    \"last_page\": 3,\n    \"total\": 31,\n    \"per_page\": 12\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Product by Slug",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (json.data && json.data.id) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('product_id', json.data.id.toString());",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/products/{{product_slug}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["products", "{{product_slug}}"]
            },
            "description": "Get a single product by its URL slug. Include slug from the list products response.\\n\\n**Try:** `hydrating-facial-serum` or `vitamin-c-moisturizer`"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Product Detail",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": 1,\n    \"name\": \"Hydrating Facial Serum\",\n    \"slug\": \"hydrating-facial-serum\",\n    \"description\": \"A lightweight, fast-absorbing serum...\",\n    \"short_description\": \"A lightweight serum for deep hydration\",\n    \"price\": 29.99,\n    \"compare_price\": 39.99,\n    \"has_discount\": true,\n    \"discount_percent\": 25,\n    \"in_stock\": true,\n    \"quantity\": 50,\n    \"sku\": \"SERUM-HYD-001\",\n    \"barcode\": null,\n    \"is_featured\": true,\n    \"category\": { ... },\n    \"images\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": 1,\n        \"url\": \"http://127.0.0.1:8000/storage/products/1-primary.jpg\",\n        \"alt\": \"Hydrating Facial Serum\",\n        \"is_primary\": true,\n        \"sort_order\": 1\n      }\n    ],\n    \"reviews_summary\": {\n      \"total\": 0,\n      \"average\": 0,\n      \"ratings\": {}\n    },\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-07-01T10:00:00.000000Z\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Search Products",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/products/search?q=serum",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["products", "search"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "q", "value": "serum", "description": "Search keyword (required, min: 2 chars)" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Search products by name, description, or SKU.\\n\\n**Try:** `serum`, `moisturizer`, `vitamin`, `mask`"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Search Results",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": [ ... ],\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"current_page\": 1,\n    \"last_page\": 1,\n    \"total\": 3,\n    \"query\": \"serum\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "📂 Categories",
      "description": "Browse categories. All endpoints are public.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Categories",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (json.data && json.data.length > 0) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('category_slug', json.data[0].slug);",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/categories",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["categories"]
            },
            "description": "List all active parent categories with nested children. Each includes product count."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Categories List",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 1,\n      \"name\": \"Skincare\",\n      \"slug\": \"skincare\",\n      \"description\": null,\n      \"image\": null,\n      \"sort_order\": 1,\n      \"products_count\": 10,\n      \"children\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": 6,\n          \"name\": \"Face Wash\",\n          \"slug\": \"face-wash\",\n          \"sort_order\": 1,\n          \"products_count\": 3,\n          \"children\": []\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Category by Slug",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/categories/{{category_slug}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["categories", "{{category_slug}}"]
            },
            "description": "Get a single category by slug with its active products (paginated).\\n\\n**Try:** `skincare`, `face-wash`, `moisturizers`"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Category Detail",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"category\": {\n      \"id\": 1,\n      \"name\": \"Skincare\",\n      \"slug\": \"skincare\",\n      \"children\": [ ... ]\n    },\n    \"products\": {\n      \"data\": [ ... ],\n      \"meta\": { \"current_page\": 1, \"last_page\": 1, \"total\": 10 }\n    }\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🛒 Cart",
      "description": "Manage the authenticated user's shopping cart. All endpoints require a Bearer token.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Cart",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/cart",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["cart"]
            },
            "description": "Get the authenticated user's cart with items, product details, totals, and quantity summary."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Cart With Items",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": 1,\n    \"items\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": 1,\n        \"product_id\": 1,\n        \"quantity\": 2,\n        \"product\": {\n          \"name\": \"Hydrating Facial Serum\",\n          \"slug\": \"hydrating-facial-serum\",\n          \"price\": 29.99,\n          \"image\": \"http://127.0.0.1:8000/storage/products/1-primary.jpg\",\n          \"in_stock\": true\n        },\n        \"subtotal\": 59.98\n      }\n    ],\n    \"total\": 59.98,\n    \"total_quantity\": 2\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Add to Cart",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (json.data && json.data.items && json.data.items.length > 0) {",
                  "        var lastItem = json.data.items[json.data.items.length - 1];",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('cart_item_id', lastItem.id.toString());",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"product_id\": {{product_id}},\n  \"quantity\": 1\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/cart",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["cart"]
            },
            "description": "Add a product to the cart. If the product is already in the cart, the quantity is incremented.\\n\\n**Validation rules:**\\n- `product_id` — required, must exist in products table\\n- `quantity` — required, integer, min:1, max:100\\n\\nReturns 400 if stock is insufficient."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Cart Item",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"product_id\": {{product_id}},\n  \"quantity\": 3\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/cart/{{cart_item_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["cart", "{{cart_item_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Update the quantity of a specific cart item. Uses the same validation as adding.\\n\\n**Note:** Replace `{{cart_item_id}}` with a real ID from the Get Cart response."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Remove Cart Item",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/cart/{{cart_item_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["cart", "{{cart_item_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Remove a specific item from the cart. Returns 403 if the item doesn't belong to the authenticated user."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "❤️ Wishlist",
      "description": "Manage the authenticated user's wishlist. All endpoints require a Bearer token.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Wishlist",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/wishlist",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["wishlist"]
            },
            "description": "Get the authenticated user's wishlist with product details (name, slug, price, stock status, image)."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Wishlist With Items",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 1,\n      \"product_id\": 1,\n      \"product\": {\n        \"id\": 1,\n        \"name\": \"Hydrating Facial Serum\",\n        \"slug\": \"hydrating-facial-serum\",\n        \"price\": 29.99,\n        \"in_stock\": true,\n        \"image\": \"http://127.0.0.1:8000/storage/products/1-primary.jpg\"\n      },\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-07-01T10:30:00.000000Z\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Add to Wishlist",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
